/* 动作详情：白底 + 分组说明，配色与动作库卡片一致（灰底标签、黑色标题） */
.head {
  padding: 8rpx 0 30rpx;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #f0f0ee;
}
.head-image {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
}
.head-placeholder {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  height: 320rpx;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  background: #f6f6f4;
  color: #b0b0ac;
  font-size: 30rpx;
}
.head-name {
  margin-top: 26rpx;
  font-size: 40rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.head-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
}
.tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  height: 40rpx;
  padding: 0 16rpx;
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  background: #f4f4f2;
  color: #8c8c88;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  line-height: 1;
}
.tag.dark {
  color: #333;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.block {
  margin-top: 30rpx;
}
.block-label {
  color: #999;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 10rpx;
}
.block-text {
  color: #333;
  font-size: 29rpx;
  line-height: 1.75;
}
